        DESCRIPTION "St. Prokopios, the first martyr of Diocletian’s persecutions, and popular in Caesarea. Saints Cosmas and Damian, twins known as Unmercenary Physicians (they healed the sick for no pay), they are saints of physicians and suburban Constantinople."
